<title>UK: Bank Austria sets 100 million stg 15-year bond.</title>
<headline>Bank Austria sets 100 million stg 15-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK AUSTRIA AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    04.NOV.11</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    04.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+45 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED LATER</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/AT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRIA   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  NONE	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 9.00 PCT GILT DUE 2012</p>
<p> NOTES	GUARANTEED BY CITY OF VIENNA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
